{"beat": 41, "name": "A TEST, THEN ANOTHER TEST", "text": "Now go back to 1932, because the company finally did it right: a test, then a rollout. But remember the West. Comparing places tells you about the places as much as the prices, unless the places are picked at random and some are left alone. Most online sellers can't do that: one listing, one price. So the test open to you is in time. A small step, measured against what you wrote down before you took it. Then the next step. Not a test and a promise. A test, then another test.", "provider": "placeholder", "words": [{"word": "Now", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.24}, {"word": "go", "start": 0.24, "end": 0.46}, {"word": "back", "start": 0.46, "end": 0.74}, {"word": "to", "start": 0.74, "end": 0.94}, {"word": "1932,", "start": 0.94, "end": 1.98}, {"word": "because", "start": 1.98, "end": 2.62}, {"word": "the", "start": 2.62, "end": 2.82}, {"word": "company", "start": 2.82, "end": 3.2}, {"word": "finally", "start": 3.2, "end": 3.74}, {"word": "did", "start": 3.74, "end": 4.02}, {"word": "it", "start": 4.02, "end": 4.12}, {"word": "right:", "start": 4.12, "end": 4.4}, {"word": "a", "start": 5.0, "end": 5.18}, {"word": "test,", "start": 5.18, "end": 5.6}, {"word": "then", "start": 6.04, "end": 6.2}, {"word": "a", "start": 6.2, "end": 6.36}, {"word": "rollout.", "start": 6.36, "end": 6.88}, {"word": "But", "start": 7.4, "end": 7.56}, {"word": "remember", "start": 7.56, "end": 7.88}, {"word": "the", "start": 7.88, "end": 8.16}, {"word": "West.", "start": 8.16, "end": 8.58}, {"word": "Comparing", "start": 9.26, "end": 9.7}, {"word": "places", "start": 9.7, "end": 10.16}, {"word": "tells", "start": 10.16, "end": 10.62}, {"word": "you", "start": 10.62, "end": 10.86}, {"word": "about", "start": 10.86, "end": 11.06}, {"word": "the", "start": 11.06, "end": 11.24}, {"word": "places", "start": 11.24, "end": 11.62}, {"word": "as", "start": 11.62, "end": 11.9}, {"word": "much", "start": 11.9, "end": 12.18}, {"word": "as", "start": 12.1